<h1>Naukri Saathi — Privacy Policy</h1>
<p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 23 October 2026</p><h2>1. About the App</h2>
<p>Naukri Saathi helps users find government job notifications, results, admit cards, exam information and study resources.</p><h2>2. Personal Information</h2>
<p>The app does not require users to create an account or log in. Based on the app's current design, saved jobs and study progress are stored locally on the user's device.</p><h2>3. Notifications and Analytics</h2>
<p>The current version is reported not to use notifications, Firebase Analytics or similar analytics services.</p><h2>4. Advertising</h2>
<p>The current version does not display advertisements. If advertising services such as Google AdMob are added in a future version, this policy will be updated to describe the information processed by those services and provide relevant disclosures.</p><h2>5. External Websites</h2>
<p>The app may link to government or other external websites. Those websites operate under their own privacy policies and terms.</p><h2>6. Data Security and Retention</h2>
<p>Locally stored information may remain on the device until it is deleted by the user or the app is uninstalled. Device backups and Android settings may affect retention.</p><h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>
<p>If you believe personal information has been collected from a child inappropriately, please contact the developer through the app's official distribution page.</p><h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>This policy may be updated when app features or data practices change. The latest version will be published on this page.</p><h2>9. Contact</h2>
<p>For privacy questions, use the developer contact details provided on the app's official distribution page.</p>
